<title>USA: Sioux City hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said weather related receipts. 10 inches of snow on ground, another 2 inches forecasted. Has been snowing for more than 24  hours. Trade was active. Compared with Monday, barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     56.00</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     55.00-56.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     53.00-55.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     scarce</p>
<p>Sows - scarce</p>
</text>
